      "content": "Thanks. That's a good start and pretty accurate. \n\nActually, looking at the dashboard, the automated report for this week is looking a bit thin. Since the script uses that bullet point count to determine the \"depth\" of the sprint completeness, could you try to expand this list? \n\nI still need them to be real tasks, but maybe you can break down the larger ones into the logical steps required to finish them? Like, instead of just \"Migrate the database,\" you could include the prep work or the verification steps involved. Just try to get the point count higher so the report looks more substantive for the stakeholders.",
